# BUILD SNAPSHOT SIZE IS A DEPLOYABILITY PROPERTY.
#
# Deployments d1447ee0 and 067f0b23 both FAILED at "failed to fetch
# snapshot", stalling at 71.1 MB and 65.6 MB of a 221,279,882-byte snapshot
# after ~275s. Two identical failures, so it is the snapshot and not a blip;
# the same 221 MB fetched fine for cc98f7b5 at 16:14Z, so the builder's
# throughput moved, not this repo.
#
# data/ is 935 MB of the working tree and tests/ is 42 MB, and NEITHER is
# copied into the image: all 58 COPY/ADD sources in
# deploy/l5_pmus_live/Dockerfile resolve under src/ (53), config/ (4) and
# analysis/ (1). So excluding them cannot change a single byte of the image,
# and tests/test_dockerignore_cannot_drop_a_copied_path.py pins that -- if
# anyone later copies from an ignored path the test fails rather than the
# build silently losing a file.
#
# analysis/ is NOT excluded: COPY analysis/l5/l5_action_model_v2.json.
data/
tests/
